			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">12, 83,
			3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fugio campum lusumque trigonem,</span>”
				<i>a game of ball</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 1, 6, 126</span></i>
			.</div>
